 row to its owner.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"In front of it are the landing page at /, /login, /signup and /forgot-password, the read-only demo at /demo/, /privacy, and /bookmarklet — the page that hands over the two capture links, one for a posting and one for a profile.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You do not need an account to see the product. /demo/overview serves the real screens over invented data from src/lib/demoFixture.ts — a file in this repository, so there is no session, no database connection and no write path behind those pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-hosting on your own Supabase project, with row-level security scoping every row to its owner — nobody's terms of service sit between you and your applications","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"That reader still exists and is local-only, because the page needs a real browser a deployment has not got — so the rail's JobStreet half runs through a paid Apify actor instead, which puts both the crawling and the choice with the operator who runs it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a567453c31719e702137546804a2569e5db61477e6c599091fd42e8dad3db8c8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:06.385Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T07:27:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NightServant/Worktrack/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:06.388Z","hash":"a567453c31719e702137546804a2569e5db61477e6c599091fd42e8dad3db8c8